0227745,6873.0307539682535,8867.825396825398,4787.701298701299],"cnt":[5,24,24,24,24,24,24,23,24,24,11]},"desc":"قصة رعب سعودية من البداية للنهاية\nاستأجرتوا استراحة بعيدة بـ ٥٠ ريال لليلة وحدة، والشايب صاحبها يرحب فيكم ويصب لكم القهوة ويوصيكم وصية وحدة\nلا تطلعون من المجلس الليلة\n\nالعبها لحالك أو مع أصحابك حتى ٤ لاعبين، اركبوا نفس السيارة من المحطة وتروحون سوا\nحلوا ألغاز الاستراحة، واهربوا منه لا طاردكم، واكتشفوا وش صار في هالبيت قبلكم\nفيها ثلاث نهايات، وكل نهاية لها وسام\nتشتغل على الجوال والكمبيوتر ويد التحكم\n\nA Saudi horror story game. You rent a remote rest house for one night. Its owner, an old man, welcomes you, pours your coffee and asks one thing: do not leave the majlis tonight.\nPlay solo or with up to 4 friends, riding the same car from the station to go together. Solve the rest house's puzzles, run when he comes for you, find out what happened here before you, and reach one of three endings.\nPlays on phone, computer and controller.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-99327705408cf62165fd7d96545e07d7/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-60eeaa15eba15b7ec58ea787964daba2/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-34d546344909390ec702099dd9a5b871/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"],"passes":[],"badges":[{"id":3113289037253942,"name":"First Ending","desc":"Dawn broke over you during the break... but not as you expected.","awarded":100794,"pastDay":22669,"winRate":0.111,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d99b2fc536f02792af3ff89540b2febe/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2341341984190605,"name":"Second Ending","desc":"One night at the break, and everything changes.","awarded":125259,"pastDay":27646,"winRate":0.135,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ee36d4af49b3d337d6947b0895ba9885/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2777987724276589,"name":"Third Ending","desc":"Few people reach it... and the story isn't over yet.","awarded":66303,"pastDay":13164,"winRate":0.064,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e342f7904007